# Sampler build output - generated, never committed
output/
# NOTE: 'docs/' was ignored here, which was a trap rather than a policy. Four documents
# under docs/ are tracked (the design spec, two reviews, the phase 1 plan) because git
# keeps tracking a file once added, so the ignore only ever applied to NEW documents -
# and it silently swallowed the phase 5 cutover record, with 'git add -A' reporting
# nothing to commit. Ignoring a directory whose contents are the project's source of
# truth cannot be right; if a generated docs artefact appears later, ignore that path
# specifically.
